## 7. Intellectual Property

The following are protected intellectual property of the CSE Newsletter Committee:

* Newsletter Automation Framework
* Editorial Generation Workflow
* Design System
* Template Architecture
* Prompt Engineering Assets
* Internal Documentation

Unauthorized reproduction is prohibited.

