## 8. Revocation of Access

The Committee reserves the right to revoke repository access at any time.

Access may be revoked due to:

* Committee departure
* Unauthorized sharing
* Policy violations
* Misuse of repository resources

Upon access revocation, users must cease usage of repository materials and delete locally stored copies if requested.

